         "children": [
          {
           "t": "heading",
           "level": "h2",
           "text": "Where Your Clothing line Logo Will Appear",
           "classes": []
          },
          {
           "t": "text",
           "html": "<p>A clothing line logo has to work in the places your customers actually see it. Logo Austin designs with these uses in mind:</p><div><table><thead><tr><th scope=\"col\">Placement</th><th scope=\"col\">Design Requirement</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>Screen-printed tees and hoodies</strong></td><td>Clean shapes and limited colors for affordable printing</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Embroidered hats and polos</strong></td><td>Thick lines and no tiny details; DST file for embroidery</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Neck labels and woven tags</strong></td><td>A compact mark legible at very small sizes</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Hang tags and packaging</strong></td><td>Premium-looking layout that matches the brand</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Instagram and online store</strong></td><td>Square icon that stands out in a feed</td></tr></tbody></table></div>",
           "classes": []
          }
         ]
        }
       ]
      }
     ]
    }
   ]
