          {
           "t": "heading",
           "level": "h2",
           "text": "Checklist for a Strong Clothing line Logo",
           "classes": []
          },
          {
           "t": "text",
           "html": "<ul><li>Ask for a compact mark in addition to the full logo.</li><li>Avoid thin strokes and gradients that are hard to stitch or print.</li><li>Limit colors to keep screen-printing costs down.</li><li>Search trademark databases before launching a brand name.</li><li>Get vector and DST files for printers and embroiderers.</li></ul>",
           "classes": []
          }
         ]
