           "t": "heading",
           "level": "h2",
           "text": "How Your Clothing line Logo Is Designed",
           "classes": []
          },
          {
           "t": "text",
           "html": "<ol><li><strong>Share your details.</strong> Business name, services, service area and any colors or symbols you want.</li><li><strong>Receive concepts.</strong> Designers create several original clothing line logo concepts, usually within hours.</li><li><strong>Revise.</strong> Adjust fonts, colors, icons and layout until the logo fits your business.</li><li><strong>Get your files.</strong> Approve, pay and receive print, web and vector files with full ownership.</li></ol><p>See also: <a href=\"/same-day-tshirt-brand-design-services-austin/\">same-day T-shirt design</a> and <a href=\"/graphic-designer-in-austin-for-clothing-brands/\">graphic design for clothing brands</a>.</p>",
