          },
          {
           "t": "heading",
           "level": "h3",
           "text": "Can my clothing logo be embroidered?",
           "classes": []
          },
          {
           "t": "text",
           "html": "<p>Yes. Logo Austin designs apparel logos with embroidery in mind and can provide a DST file for embroidery machines.</p>",
           "classes": []
          },
          {
           "t": "heading",
           "level": "h3",
           "text": "Do I need more than one version of my clothing logo?",
           "classes": []
          },
          {
           "t": "text",
           "html": "<p>Most clothing brands need a primary logo and a compact mark for labels, tags and hats. Logo Austin can design both.</p>",
           "classes": []
          },
          {
           "t": "heading",
           "level": "h3",
           "text": "How much does a clothing line logo cost?",
           "classes": []
          },
          {
           "t": "text",
           "html": "<p>At Logo Austin, a custom clothing line logo is priced from $125 to $175. There is no upfront charge; you pay only after approving the final design.</p>",
           "classes": []
          },
          {
           "t": "heading",
           "level": "h3",
           "text": "How fast can I get my clothing line logo?",
           "classes": []
          },
          {
           "t": "text",
           "html": "<p>Logo Austin usually delivers multiple clothing line logo concepts the same day. Final files in JPG, PNG, SVG, PDF, AI and EPS follow as soon as you approve a design, with full ownership.</p>",
           "classes": []
          }
         ]
        }
